{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "locale": "zh-CN",
  "scenario_id": "1_2_014_01_b",
  "source_raw_hash": "sha256:19fa9482794bcad9f9e9b58a94e0f579e3a4587671bd2e6cec274cc435125060",
  "entries": {
    "story-text:v1:1_2_014hid_01_1_2_014_01:1_2_014_01_b:cmd-000014:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a1760fa545f60e77605d46c2816a8eb0217ce4a70de85c3f854fad0e4351239e",
      "text": "谢谢你邀请我。\n这家店我一直想着什么时候来一次呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_014hid_01_1_2_014_01:1_2_014_01_b:cmd-000022:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:bf1d13891e90a53132e1df1f65d60aa85e0a4cfa3478fa97f331cf3a7801e0ff",
      "text": "不过看起来还要排一会儿队啊。趁现在看看菜单决定点什么吧。稍微等我一下。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_014hid_01_1_2_014_01:1_2_014_01_b:cmd-000031:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b9382ae2b03688dc0f24872f403cd6b9f5c438457c7e3a678239854b9898acf3",
      "text": "查一下店名……\n……找到了。喏，这就是菜单。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_014hid_01_1_2_014_01:1_2_014_01_b:cmd-000034:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:3d321020705d4ba2ba52b9fd2afd9642da9d694155f35fdf731bcb1ecf842931",
      "text": "谢谢您。\n种类真多，配料也很丰富呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_014hid_01_1_2_014_01:1_2_014_01_b:cmd-000040:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c1e265de0ffeaa652cc202803db9157f436b7932e2eeed9e3f8e9b41c6e01d6e",
      "text": "是啊。听说不管是甜品系还是主食系，\n两边的松饼都很美味，很有话题度呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_014hid_01_1_2_014_01:1_2_014_01_b:cmd-000044:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e508b7f3f849f2f7066fe795c73b55b0b186220d2ef8344770bf771f214333d0",
      "text": "●●●●プロデューサー选哪种？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_014hid_01_1_2_014_01:1_2_014_01_b:cmd-000047:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:eab0bb8eb454580055c6d9d38e6a5f09e0d2422519c4a4e9c76b8468af847498",
      "text": "真纠结啊……\n我选这个期间限定的吧！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_014hid_01_1_2_014_01:1_2_014_01_b:cmd-000054:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:faac7f449dc604baeaf7ddba8fae621082db2f51543138b84dc85d8e738553c0",
      "text": "啊，那个我也纠结过！\n看着很好吃啊。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_014hid_01_1_2_014_01:1_2_014_01_b:cmd-000061:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f108bec255256337cbeaad435a5606892e22e93ae0cd2fd0a892ed942d0d2613",
      "text": "那么我的话……唔——选哪个好呢……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_014hid_01_1_2_014_01:1_2_014_01_b:cmd-000073:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:96248c2108b0bb17d04ff00e54ac80de14c5dba107497e5e698c06e3115c6ce7",
      "text": "好，决定了。我就要这个招牌松饼吧。\n现在就已经开始期待吃到了啊。",
      "status": "draft"
    }
  }
}
